# Flutter build output, tooling caches and IDE files are ignored by
# 3-code/.gitignore, which applies to everything beneath that folder.

# Shipped APKs. Each is ~47 MB, and git keeps every version forever: the four
# built so far would add ~190 MB to the history that no later commit can
# remove without rewriting it. Attach them to a GitHub Release instead, where
# they are downloadable but not cloned.
5-releases/*.apk

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
